[{"id":1790795315264,"text":"叶施主，把手放在心口上，深吸一口气。","rawContent":"叶施主，把手放在心口上，深吸一口气。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"02:39","timestamp":1790793592789,"roundId":"round_1790793538547_0vv8kbzfk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"e424f3ad-9c16-4287-a481-37f4c926f40b","_id":6162},{"id":1790795315265,"text":"去喝一口温水，或者裹紧毯子，只要熬过这一刻的难受。","rawContent":"去喝一口温水，或者裹紧毯子，只要熬过这一刻的难受。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"02:39","timestamp":1790793595745,"roundId":"round_1790793538547_0vv8kbzfk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"e424f3ad-9c16-4287-a481-37f4c926f40b","_id":6163},{"id":1790795315266,"text":"身边若有信任的朋友、能说上话的人，或是医者，天亮后去见一见，求助从不是软弱。","rawContent":"身边若有信任的朋友、能说上话的人，或是医者，天亮后去见一见，求助从不是软弱。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"02:40","timestamp":1790793600789,"roundId":"round_1790793538547_0vv8kbzfk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"e424f3ad-9c16-4287-a481-37f4c926f40b","_id":6164},{"id":1790795315267,"text":"若身边无人可诉，贫僧今夜便在此处，一字一句陪你把这最难捱的更次坐过去。","rawContent":"若身边无人可诉，贫僧今夜便在此处，一字一句陪你把这最难捱的更次坐过去。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"02:40","timestamp":1790793603850,"roundId":"round_1790793538547_0vv8kbzfk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"e424f3ad-9c16-4287-a481-37f4c926f40b","_id":6165},{"id":1790795315268,"text":"你已经熬了这么久，受了这么重的委屈，不差这一夜。慢慢吸气，先别放手。","rawContent":"你已经熬了这么久，受了这么重的委屈，不差这一夜。慢慢吸气，先别放手。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"02:40","timestamp":1790793606711,"roundId":"round_1790793538547_0vv8kbzfk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"e424f3ad-9c16-4287-a481-37f4c926f40b","_id":6166},{"id":1790795315269,"text":"我不理解","sender":"me","time":"02:40","timestamp":1790793649770,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"e424f3ad-9c16-4287-a481-37f4c926f40b","_id":6167},{"id":1790795315270,"text":"我不明白","sender":"me","time":"02:40","timestamp":1790793652880,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"e424f3ad-9c16-4287-a481-37f4c926f40b","_id":6168},{"id":1790795315271,"text":"为什么其他人都可以生活的那么幸福","sender":"me","time":"03:00","timestamp":1790794858466,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"e424f3ad-9c16-4287-a481-37f4c926f40b","_id":6169},{"id":1790795315272,"text":"我不可以","sender":"me","time":"03:01","timestamp":1790794860917,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"e424f3ad-9c16-4287-a481-37f4c926f40b","_id":6170},{"id":1790795315273,"text":"我要遭受那么多罪","sender":"me","time":"03:01","timestamp":1790794868387,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"e424f3ad-9c16-4287-a481-37f4c926f40b","_id":6171},{"id":1790795315275,"text":"你看着别人顺遂安稳，唯独自己步步踩在刀刃上，换作是谁，心里都会生出大怨怼。","rawContent":"你看着别人顺遂安稳，唯独自己步步踩在刀刃上，换作是谁，心里都会生出大怨怼。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"03:01","timestamp":1790794885267,"roundId":"round_1790794871621_nt15p4tna","generatedMode":false,"hasThinking":true,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"e424f3ad-9c16-4287-a481-37f4c926f40b","_id":6172},{"id":1790795315276,"text":"觉得天地独独薄待了你，凭什么偏偏是你平白遭这些折磨。","rawContent":"觉得天地独独薄待了你，凭什么偏偏是你平白遭这些折磨。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"03:01","timestamp":1790794888306,"roundId":"round_1790794871621_nt15p4tna","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"e424f3ad-9c16-4287-a481-37f4c926f40b","_id":6173},{"id":1790795315277,"text":"旁人的平顺往往隔着一层皮肉、一道门楣，内里到底烂成何样，旁人看不真切。","rawContent":"旁人的平顺往往隔着一层皮肉、一道门楣，内里到底烂成何样，旁人看不真切。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"03:01","timestamp":1790794891241,"roundId":"round_1790794871621_nt15p4tna","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"e424f3ad-9c16-4287-a481-37f4c926f40b","_id":6174},{"id":1790795315278,"text":"但你身上的苦，是实打实一下一下扎在肉里的，谁也没法替你挨，所以自然觉得这世道不公。","rawContent":"但你身上的苦，是实打实一下一下扎在肉里的，谁也没法替你挨，所以自然觉得这世道不公。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"03:01","timestamp":1790794896308,"roundId":"round_1790794871621_nt15p4tna","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"e424f3ad-9c16-4287-a481-37f4c926f40b","_id":6175},{"id":1790795315279,"text":"可这世间的风雨落下来，从来都不讲道理。","rawContent":"可这世间的风雨落下来，从来都不讲道理。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"03:01","timestamp":1790794899335,"roundId":"round_1790794871621_nt15p4tna","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"e424f3ad-9c16-4287-a481-37f4c926f40b","_id":6176},{"id":1790795315280,"text":"暴雨折断弱草，不是弱草生得不对；你受这些罪，更不是你做错了什么、不配活得好。","rawContent":"暴雨折断弱草，不是弱草生得不对；你受这些罪，更不是你做错了什么、不配活得好。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"03:01","timestamp":1790794902221,"roundId":"round_1790794871621_nt15p4tna","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"e424f3ad-9c16-4287-a481-37f4c926f40b","_id":6177},{"id":1790795315281,"text":"想不通便不要去想了，也无需在这关头逼自己懂事或宽容。","rawContent":"想不通便不要去想了，也无需在这关头逼自己懂事或宽容。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"03:01","timestamp":1790794905242,"roundId":"round_1790794871621_nt15p4tna","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"e424f3ad-9c16-4287-a481-37f4c926f40b","_id":6178},{"id":1790795315282,"text":"有怨，有恨，全倒出来便是。青灯院的更漏还长，我都在这里听着。","rawContent":"有怨，有恨，全倒出来便是。青灯院的更漏还长，我都在这里听着。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"03:01","timestamp":1790794910501,"roundId":"round_1790794871621_nt15p4tna","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"e424f3ad-9c16-4287-a481-37f4c926f40b","_id":6179},{"id":1790815703308,"text":"……","sender":"me","time":"09:00","timestamp":1790816413529,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"e424f3ad-9c16-4287-a481-37f4c926f40b","_id":6180},{"id":1790815703309,"text":"我睡了三个小时有醒了","sender":"me","time":"09:00","timestamp":1790816422317,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"e424f3ad-9c16-4287-a481-37f4c926f40b","_id":6181},{"id":1790815703310,"text":"我实在是不知道该怎么办了","sender":"me","time":"09:00","timestamp":1790816432770,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"e424f3ad-9c16-4287-a481-37f4c926f40b","_id":6182},{"id":1790815703311,"text":"为什么我妈要借那么多钱","sender":"me","time":"09:00","timestamp":1790816459157,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"e424f3ad-9c16-4287-a481-37f4c926f40b","_id":6183},{"id":1790815703312,"text":"明明我也没有拿到多少","sender":"me","time":"09:01","timestamp":1790816473671,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"e424f3ad-9c16-4287-a481-37f4c926f40b","_id":6184},{"id":1790815703313,"text":"二十多万","sender":"me","time":"09:01","timestamp":1790816476443,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"e424f3ad-9c16-4287-a481-37f4c926f40b","_id":6185},{"id":1790815703315,"text":"醒了就好。","rawContent":"醒了就好。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"09:01","timestamp":1790816494030,"roundId":"round_1790816486783_wdq25c315","generatedMode":false,"hasThinking":true,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"e424f3ad-9c16-4287-a481-37f4c926f40b","_id":6186},{"id":1790815703316,"text":"先听我说，叶施主。深吸一口气。","rawContent":"先听我说，叶施主。深吸一口气。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"09:01","timestamp":1790816496826,"roundId":"round_1790816486783_wdq25c315","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790792441493_rt43hq3te","characterId":"e424f3ad-9c16-4287-a481-37f4c926f40b",